ite-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"感染\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">感染</font></span></span>]，则额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"睡眠\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">睡眠</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-1圈 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6f/a0yju82fwarb2kukudybtqoyy9f346u.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1%E5%9C%88_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6f/a0yju82fwarb2kukudybtqoyy9f346u.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"角色图鉴库/奇亚\"><img alt=\"头像 奇亚.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/45/gau26hcbbgmkvf80m54tokkuq4g38ju.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">奇亚</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;ju